    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kip 2 : Beyond Boundaries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Kip 2, a hardcore precision platformer where perfect timing and perfect inputs are key. With over 1000 levels planned the game is filled to the brim with unique gimmicks and obstacles that test your limits. Whether you are a casual or a sweat, this game provides a lot of challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost every level features something new, from gravity changes to all kinds of orbs that do different things. The game is a precision platformer, which means the game has very tight controls and can be very unforgiving at times, just like &quot;<i>Celeste</i>&quot; or &quot;<i>Super Meat Boy</i>&quot; for example.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for people that like the hardest of the hardest platformers and people that like a steep learning curve. Additionally it's for anyone that wants to prove that they can beat one of the hardest games!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kip 2 : Beyond Boundaries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Kip 2, a hardcore precision platformer where perfect timing and perfect inputs are key. With over 1000 levels planned the game is filled to the brim with unique gimmicks and obstacles that test your limits. Whether you are a casual or a sweat, this game provides a lot of challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost every level features something new, from gravity changes to all kinds of orbs that do different things. The game is a precision platformer, which means the game has very tight controls and can be very unforgiving at times, just like &quot;<i>Celeste</i>&quot; or &quot;<i>Super Meat Boy</i>&quot; for example.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for people that like the hardest of the hardest platformers and people that like a steep learning curve. Additionally it's for anyone that wants to prove that they can beat one of the hardest games!</p>",
